msgctxt "quest/024/StmBda113_02453:TEXT_STMBDA113_02453_MAGITEKVANGUARD_BATTLETALK_005_009:1"
msgid "Initiating self-destruct in:<br>Five... Four... Three... Two... One..."
msgstr "Самоуничтожение через:<br>пять... четыре... три... два... один..."

#. ja: そそそ、そんな馬鹿な～！<br>オラの新兵器がやられちまったど～！
#. de: Was macht ihr da? Ihr habt ja meinen schönen Prototypen kaputt gemacht!
